verse = \lyricmode {
  But I cry out to you, O \markup { \smallCaps "Lord;" }
my prayer I of -- fer ev -- ery morn -- ing.
O \markup { \smallCaps "Lord," } why do you keep on scor -- ning
my fer -- vent pleas, as if un -- heard?
Why do you cast me off and leave me?
Why do you hide your face to grieve me?
}
